From 6a5c1a17acdd963c00d1272412ef3314991a90fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coconutnutx <coconutnutxs@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Apr 2026 11:28:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(memory+context): add oG-Memory adapters for QwenPaw

Add OGMemoryMemoryManager (session owner, 5 POST helpers, after_turn/compact public API)
and OGMemoryContextManager (BaseContextManager subclass, delegates to mm).
Also fix PROVIDER_OPENAI to read OPENAI_BASE_URL from env.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
